Certificate behavior:
- Only shown when `detail.status === "checked_in"`.
- GET /participant/participations/{id}/certificate returns `{ available, certificate }`.
- `available: false` → shows "not yet issued" explanation (deferred state; do not fake a download link).
- `available: true` → shows download button using `certificate.file_url` (preferred) or `getMediaUrl(certificate.file_path)`. Verified flag shown.
- Participants have read-only access to certificate state. The Web App does not issue or re-issue certificates; `GET .../certificate` is the only certificate surface available to participants.

