### 2026-08-19 — Prompt 3 — Participant registration + WaafiPay + ticket page

Files:

- `src/services/participationService.ts` (new) — typed wrappers for `POST /participant/participations`, `POST /participant/payments/charge` (210s timeout), `GET /participant/participations/{id}`
- `src/pages/Register.tsx` — full registration flow: ticket selection (with sold-out state), dynamic form with all 5 field types (text/number/select/checkbox/date), create participation, free/waitlisted/paid branches, WaafiPay phone step, payment success/failure screens, navigation safety (`beforeunload` warning during active charge)
- `src/pages/Ticket.tsx` — wired to `GET /participant/participations/{id}`; QR uses `qr_token`; waitlisted and pending-payment states shown without QR; unauthenticated users redirected to `/auth`
- `src/App.tsx` — added `/registrations/:registrationId` route alias to Ticket page
- `src/lib/publicEventsAdapters.ts` — `UiFormField` expanded: added `key` field, updated `field_type` to cover `text|number|select|checkbox|date`, fixed `adaptUiFormFields` to pass through backend `key`

Changes:

- `custom_field_answers` now uses the backend `key` (not the `label`).
- RegistrationForm renders all 5 Laravel `FormFieldType` values with native inputs.
- WaafiPay phone step is presented inline inside the cinematic PublicEventPage form slot.
- Charge request uses `timeout: 210_000` on the Axios config; UX shows elapsed seconds and "can take up to 3 minutes" copy.
- Navigation safety: `window.beforeunload` fires warning while charge is in flight; user is never permanently trapped.
- Ticket page loads real participation data; QR encodes `qr_token`; waitlist/pending states degrade gracefully without a QR.

Edge cases handled:

- Duplicate participation → toast "You're already registered"
- Deadline passed → toast "Registration deadline has passed"
- Sold out (race) → Laravel 400 propagated to toast
- Invalid/disabled ticket type → toast
- Required form field missing → client-side validation toast
- WaafiPay failure → failure_reason surfaced with retry button
- WaafiPay "already pending" → error message (do not retry with same reference)
- WaafiPay "already paid" (race win) → re-fetch participation and show success
- Network timeout → Axios timeout error after 210s; user sees failure card with retry

